  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The transversal support is provided directly to the in-country implementation teams. The government is usually a member of the implementation team. Thus, indirect support is provided to governments. The in-country projects are negotiated between concerned EU Delegations, governments and implementing partners. Therefore, the objectives of the in-country projects are aligned with the cooperation agreements between the EU and the country.</narrative>
